<title>ARGENTINA: Argentina's Angel Estrada approves bond program.</title>
<headline>Argentina's Angel Estrada approves bond program.</headline>
<dateline>BUENOS AIRES 1996-08-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Argentine publishing company Angel Estrada y Cia SA approved a $30 million short- and medium-term non-convertible bond program, the company said Monday.</p>
<p>Citicorp Capital Markets SA will underwrite the issue. The bonds will be issued over three years, said Angel Estrada.</p>
<p>-- Axel Bugge, Buenos Aires newsroom, 541 3180668</p>
